, investigated by the International Criminal Court, is a hybrid word derived from the Greek for \'tribe\' and the Latin for \'kill\'?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Genocide was codified as an international crime by the 1948 UN Genocide Convention, decades before the International Criminal Court began operating.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7eda-8c47-6fcf5aeb4434","description":"Genocide","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-772e-8004-191ec485d441","description":"Homicide","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7bd8-86b3-2234bf56204a","description":"Suicide","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-79bd-88e5-8ced44a67f37","description":"Fratricide","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-72d9-9eae-7ebe285ab44d","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the meaning of the Latin phrase \'Tendit in ardua virtus\'?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Tendit in ardua virtus means \u201cVirtue strives for what is difficult.\u201d Virtus can also mean courage, while ardua describes challenging or lofty things.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3736-70c6-acb9-a07cacf290d2","description":"Virtue strives for what is difficult","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7860-8c6d-98883cfbd795","description":"Such is life","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-70d3-8ebe-fd75f618f2cd","description":"Tender is the loving mother","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7655-86fe-db88ddd74f20","description":"Become good through ardor","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-76fc-bc5b-1c9614b0b399","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"From which country do pre-embargo 1950s Romeo y Julietas, a type of cigar, sell for as much as $400 each?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Cuba\'s Romeo y Julieta cigar brand was established in Havana in the 19th century and takes its name from Shakespeare\'s tragedy.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7632-9004-1970360