s face during prayer, and the annual Hajj pilgrimage is centered there.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7c47-9f6d-aaa985aed6cd","description":"Mecca","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7f00-afc6-75b5e6636ab8","description":"Jerusalem","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7cf7-aac8-b063b1872507","description":"Baghdad","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-769b-8c4a-3f1c8400fbfc","description":"Istanbul","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-704f-ae79-258299f2b993","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which car manufacturer makes the Model T?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Ford introduced the Model T in 1908. The company later used moving assembly lines to produce cars at a scale that helped lower costs.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7509-9fc3-b2a33451c564","description":"Ford","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-722f-9628-b3dc62f63494","description":"BMW","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7e0a-9579-43a9bd6c2db5","description":"AC","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7870-b08b-f982ffc9aef8","description":"Honda","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7b71-8886-127b5c6aa890","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of the following is NOT an official language of Switzerland?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Switzerland recognizes German, French, Italian, and Romansh as national languages. Spanish is not among them.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7601-9b9e-9d181c6190b4","description":"Spanish","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-796b-b36d-5fda1f9d7d44","description":"German","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7890-adb2-307026164819","description":"French","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7451-9f5b-1819dafd827a","description":"Italian","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3736-7db3-a99b-e4bb59d948eb","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a